  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights for Ukraine - UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this cooperation is to promote human rights and their effective protection with the support of the National Human Rights Institution, i.e. the Human Rights Ombudsperson&#x2019;s Office. The engagement covers all Ukraine, including remote areas, and aims to build capacities of civil society organisations (CSOs) focusing on defending human rights, as well as supporting duty-bearers for the prevention of violations and the promotion human rights. There is a specific focus on context-related issues, in particular protracted economic hardship, large-scale governance reform and the consequences of conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
